# Normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout (Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true stay LF too:
# tests slice index.html and compare generated docs byte for byte).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.wav binary
*.oga binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pb binary
